e mouth of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#mississippi-river">Mississippi</a> and claims <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#louisiana">Louisiana</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1701</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#great-peace-of-montreal">Great Peace of Montreal</a> ends war with the Iroquois Confederacy</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1759</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#quebec">Quebec</a> falls after the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#battle-of-the-plains-of-abraham">Battle of the Plains of Abraham</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1763</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#treaty-of-paris-1763">Treaty of Paris</a> cedes <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#canada">Canada</a> to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#britain">Britain</a></span></li></ol>
